2026-07-27T07:52:36.1228713Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1294074Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1294735Z i /tmp/RtmpshehMb/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1295052Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1295409Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1296130Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1296631Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1297460Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1298287Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1525083Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:36.1629229Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:36.2065337Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:36.2230686Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
